1
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:48,020
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,210 --> 00:01:51,030
[Episode 6]

3
00:02:06,430 --> 00:02:07,930
Thanks... Thank you.

4
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,290
Well, this is...

5
00:02:26,370 --> 00:02:27,370
From the company.

6
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:29,910
Thank you.

7
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:40,250
I was starving,

8
00:02:40,250 --> 00:02:41,810
so I ate another portion.

9
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,150
Did I take his portion?

10
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:57,970
I'm also quite hungry today.

11
00:03:00,650 --> 00:03:02,580
W-Well, then, you should eat more.

12
00:03:33,370 --> 00:03:34,120
Since you're done,

13
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,320
I'll throw your wrapper away with mine.

14
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,770
♪ It's as if I hear a voice ♪

15
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:11,800
♪ Telling me to bravely follow my heart ♪

16
00:04:14,060 --> 00:04:16,510
♪ Until you came along ♪

17
00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:20,170
♪ And made my heart skip a beat ♪

18
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,310
♪ Not much has to be said ♪

19
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:27,660
♪ One look is all it takes ♪

20
00:04:29,210 --> 00:04:31,210
♪ That distant silhouette ♪

21
00:04:31,230 --> 00:04:35,490
♪ Became crystal clear in this moment ♪

22
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,270
♪ It's you ♪

23
00:04:39,290 --> 00:04:41,590
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

24
00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:43,140
♪ Just you ♪

25
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:45,530
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

26
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,940
♪ This moon tonight ♪

27
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:49,200
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

28
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:52,520
♪ And keeps me company through
the endless night ♪

29
00:04:52,970 --> 00:04:54,640
♪ It's you ♪

30
00:04:54,670 --> 00:04:56,830
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

31
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:57,890
♪ Just you ♪

32
00:04:58,170 --> 00:05:00,510
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

33
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:01,960
♪ By your side ♪

34
00:05:01,990 --> 00:05:03,060
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

35
00:05:03,090 --> 00:05:05,440
♪ Feel warm again ♪

36
00:05:06,490 --> 00:05:08,890
♪ It's you ♪

37
00:05:12,770 --> 00:05:13,430
Thanks.

38
00:05:22,930 --> 00:05:23,990
Put this on to avoid

39
00:05:24,060 --> 00:05:24,990
catching a cold.

40
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,190
♪ It's you ♪

41
00:05:27,210 --> 00:05:29,520
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

42
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:30,430
Let me dry you, too.

43
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:31,060
♪ Just you ♪

44
00:05:31,090 --> 00:05:33,450
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

45
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,860
♪ This moon tonight ♪

46
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:37,120
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

47
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:40,450
♪ And keeps me company through
the endless night ♪

48
00:05:40,890 --> 00:05:42,560
♪ It's you ♪

49
00:05:42,590 --> 00:05:44,750
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

50
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:44,930
I'll do it myself.

51
00:05:44,790 --> 00:05:45,810
♪ Just you ♪

52
00:05:46,090 --> 00:05:48,430
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

53
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,980
♪ By your side ♪

54
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,980
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

55
00:05:51,010 --> 00:05:53,360
♪ Feel warm again ♪

56
00:05:54,409 --> 00:05:56,810
♪ It's you ♪

57
00:06:26,250 --> 00:06:27,000
Feifei,

58
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:28,750
since you're on field duty today,

59
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:30,100
you can get off work early.

60
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,330
Thanks, Mr. Qin.

61
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,720
I'll take my leave then.

62
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:33,800
See you next week, Mr. Qin.

63
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,800
See you next week.

64
00:06:41,810 --> 00:06:42,430
Yun Li!

65
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,659
Come over here.

66
00:06:55,450 --> 00:06:56,330
Mr. Qin.

67
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,500
This is urgent.

68
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:00,860
Help me sort out

69
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,890
the player feedback

70
00:07:01,890 --> 00:07:03,300
from the experience center.

71
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,980
I need them for tomorrow's meeting.

72
00:07:04,980 --> 00:07:07,190
You need so many of them sorted out today?

73
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:09,660
The R&D department
needs a large sample of data,

74
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:10,800
and they need it urgently.

75
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,200
Just work some overtime.

76
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:13,930
Go for it, Yun Li.

77
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:19,250
"Go for it, Yun Li."

78
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,700
How could he even say that?

79
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,430
You're back.

80
00:07:31,390 --> 00:07:33,070
It's pouring rain outside, isn't it?

81
00:07:33,070 --> 00:07:33,510
Dry yourself.

82
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:34,070
Thanks.

83
00:07:35,310 --> 00:07:36,310
Everything about Nanwu is great,

84
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:37,920
except for the frequent rain.

85
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,870
That's just how Nanwu is,

86
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:39,950
with endless rain.

87
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:41,390
Hurry back to your room,
take a hot shower,

88
00:07:41,390 --> 00:07:42,650
and get some good rest.

89
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,360
Thank you.

90
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,040
Good night.

91
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,720
Fu Zhengchu.

92
00:07:58,190 --> 00:07:58,990
What's wrong?

93
00:07:59,270 --> 00:08:01,190
What happened between you and Tangy?

94
00:08:01,190 --> 00:08:02,040
What do you mean?

95
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,950
What happened between us?

96
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,150
Check the group chat.

97
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,930
What on earth happened?

98
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,160
Where's Lili?

99
00:08:12,270 --> 00:08:13,870
She's still not off work yet?

100
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:14,560
Nope.

101
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,480
If I can't afford to mess with her,
I can at least hide.

102
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,240
Fu Zhengchu!

103
00:08:18,950 --> 00:08:19,800
What's up?

104
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,490
Give me your phone.

105
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:22,560
What for?

106
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,600
Your phone.

107
00:08:23,950 --> 00:08:24,390
Hurry!

108
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:26,950
Tangy, your phone.

109
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:29,510
What's this all about?

110
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,950
You two, add each other

111
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:32,909
on WeChat right now,

112
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:35,870
so you won't bother me
with every little thing.

113
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:37,549
Done.

114
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:05,200
Finished.

115
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:06,750
Awesome, Yun Li,

116
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:08,200
you finished all of them.

117
00:09:08,730 --> 00:09:10,010
Save, save...

118
00:09:14,770 --> 00:09:15,940
It's this late?

119
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:19,440
The last bus...

120
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,820
I won't make it.

121
00:09:59,590 --> 00:10:00,390
Wait a minute!

122
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,580
Wait...

123
00:11:41,270 --> 00:11:43,270
It's 10 o'clock! The special offers start!

124
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:45,840
-20% off for all the soon-to-expire items.
-Wel...

125
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:47,620
-Welcome...
-Spend a little for a feast!

126
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:49,010
Miss it, and you'll have to wait
for tomorrow's.

127
00:11:49,010 --> 00:11:50,340
Come and grab a bargain!

128
00:12:10,310 --> 00:12:10,810
Hello.

129
00:12:18,170 --> 00:12:19,370
I didn't get this.

130
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:21,410
It's a free gift.

131
00:12:21,890 --> 00:12:22,620
Thank you.

132
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:28,360
Sorry,

133
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:30,320
I didn't know you were at work today

134
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:32,390
and didn't bring the umbrella over.

135
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,240
It's okay. No rush.

136
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:38,550
Did you just start working here?

137
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:40,240
How come I haven't seen you before?

138
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,300
Yeah, I'm new here.

139
00:12:42,630 --> 00:12:43,840
Then I'll return the umbrella

140
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,130
to you next time I come.

141
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:46,500
Deal.

142
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,790
Do you want...

143
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:48,750
No, thank you.

144
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:54,060
To add me on WeChat...

145
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,000
Lili,

146
00:13:16,290 --> 00:13:17,790
what time did you get home last night?

147
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:19,550
Why didn't you reply to my messages again?

148
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:21,100
I probably fell asleep.

149
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,440
What's up with your voice?

150
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:24,800
Did you catch a cold?

151
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:26,790
Probably.

152
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:28,720
Then you should get some good rest at home

153
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,120
instead of going to work.

154
00:13:30,150 --> 00:13:31,860
I just started working,
and I'm asking for leave?

155
00:13:31,860 --> 00:13:32,990
Is that really okay?

156
00:13:33,290 --> 00:13:35,490
I'll be fine after drinking more water.

157
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:36,760
Where are you?

158
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:38,390
I'll send you some medicine.

159
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,130
I'm on my way.

160
00:13:40,150 --> 00:13:41,100
Almost there.

161
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:43,210
Don't push yourself too hard.

162
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,200
Tell me anytime

163
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,400
if anything happens.

164
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:46,250
I got it.

165
00:13:46,250 --> 00:13:47,650
I'll listen to you, boss.

166
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:48,890
Bye-bye.

167
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,970
If my skateboard doesn't arrive soon,

168
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:10,440
running a marathon like this every day

169
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,790
will kill me first.

170
00:14:24,770 --> 00:14:25,500
Hello?

171
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:27,030
Where are you?

172
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:28,740
What do you mean?

173
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:30,230
I mean,

174
00:14:30,260 --> 00:14:32,190
where are you right now?

175
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:34,530
I'm... in the classroom.

176
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:36,790
Panting like that,

177
00:14:36,790 --> 00:14:38,290
you say you're in the classroom?

178
00:14:38,290 --> 00:14:39,100
Turn around.

179
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:40,290
Turn around?

180
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:45,980
Get on.

181
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:48,420
Your bike doesn't have a rear seat.

182
00:14:48,420 --> 00:14:49,400
Where do I get on?

183
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:50,320
Cut the crap.

184
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:51,390
Get on.

185
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:52,950
Or you'll really be late.

186
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,370
When did you add a seat to it?

187
00:14:58,350 --> 00:14:59,310
None of your business.

188
00:14:59,310 --> 00:15:00,770
I put it on when I wanted to.

189
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,770
I don't really want to know anyway.

190
00:15:17,770 --> 00:15:19,030
Yun Li, you have a cold?

191
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:22,820
I'm fine.

192
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:23,890
Drink some warm water, and I'll be fine.

193
00:15:23,890 --> 00:15:25,250
Then take care and get some good rest.

194
00:15:25,250 --> 00:15:26,230
Thank you, Qian.

195
00:15:52,930 --> 00:15:53,790
See you around.

196
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:54,630
Bye-bye.

197
00:15:58,100 --> 00:16:00,810
Take 2 pills at a time.

198
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:06,690
The materials are ready

199
00:16:06,710 --> 00:16:08,200
for your review, sir.

200
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:23,000
That place offers really delicious food.

201
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:23,820
I made a reservation

202
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,870
right after you mentioned it last time.

203
00:16:25,870 --> 00:16:26,730
Okay, bye-bye.

204
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,510
Yun Li, I'm off.

205
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:29,960
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

206
00:16:30,110 --> 00:16:31,160
I'm off. Bye-bye.

207
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:47,170
You still haven't finished this yet?

208
00:16:47,170 --> 00:16:48,970
You're too inefficient, Yun Li.

209
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:51,270
I only have one page to go.

210
00:16:51,290 --> 00:16:52,410
You still need

211
00:16:52,410 --> 00:16:54,270
to improve your work efficiency.

212
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:56,550
You can't always do ineffective overtime.

213
00:16:56,550 --> 00:16:57,360
At this rate,

214
00:16:57,770 --> 00:16:59,370
how can I approve your overtime pay?

215
00:16:59,370 --> 00:16:59,960
I...

216
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:00,460
Mr. Qin,

217
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:02,790
I don't think
I asked for any overtime pay.

218
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:04,250
I forgot

219
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:05,180
that interns

220
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:07,180
don't have overtime pay anyway.

221
00:17:08,569 --> 00:17:10,180
But I like your attitude.

222
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:12,160
You're surely going to get

223
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,349
the only regular position.

224
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:14,140
Do your best.

225
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:35,810
It's done.

226
00:17:44,180 --> 00:17:45,270
Well, Mr. Qin.

227
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:46,980
I've wrapped it up.

228
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:47,980
I'm leaving them here.

229
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:48,880
I'm getting off work now.

230
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,680
Hold on.

231
00:17:50,270 --> 00:17:51,510
This batch of purchase orders

232
00:17:51,510 --> 00:17:53,380
needs to be sorted out
and entered into the system again.

233
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:54,840
Get it done for me tonight.

234
00:17:56,190 --> 00:17:58,400
Do they have to be submitted tonight?

235
00:17:58,460 --> 00:18:00,250
We're in urgent need of them
for tomorrow's meeting.

236
00:18:00,250 --> 00:18:01,910
I have no other choice either.

237
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:04,080
How about this?

238
00:18:04,610 --> 00:18:05,610
I'll stay here with you.

239
00:18:05,610 --> 00:18:07,610
Give them to me whenever you finish.

240
00:18:10,460 --> 00:18:11,390
Get back to work.

241
00:18:46,380 --> 00:18:47,180
Never mind,

242
00:18:47,350 --> 00:18:49,950
at least he's willing to work overtime
with me.

243
00:19:40,770 --> 00:19:41,400
No way.

244
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:43,430
I can't just put up with this.

245
00:19:56,380 --> 00:19:57,200
Is it fun?

246
00:20:00,090 --> 00:20:01,750
Aren't you going to continue?

247
00:20:02,180 --> 00:20:02,980
Fu,

248
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,270
we're on the same team.

249
00:20:04,270 --> 00:20:05,270
Cut me some slack.

250
00:20:06,090 --> 00:20:07,820
Which group should I send it to?

251
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:13,180
Mr. Qin,

252
00:20:14,630 --> 00:20:16,720
I need to talk to you.

253
00:20:19,740 --> 00:20:20,530
Go ahead.

254
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:22,050
I think

255
00:20:22,050 --> 00:20:23,380
the work you assigned me today

256
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:24,640
is very unreasonable.

257
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:25,980
This work doesn't have

258
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:27,400
to be completed today.

259
00:20:27,930 --> 00:20:29,570
You said you'd stay late with me,

260
00:20:29,570 --> 00:20:30,830
and I thought you needed

261
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:31,570
the purchase materials urgently,

262
00:20:31,570 --> 00:20:33,200
but you turned out to be playing games.

263
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,290
In the end, I got it done

264
00:20:34,290 --> 00:20:35,330
all by myself.

265
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:37,860
Yun Li!

266
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,240
I was just trying

267
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,940
to give you more opportunities!

268
00:20:40,940 --> 00:20:41,500
You've

269
00:20:41,500 --> 00:20:42,480
forced work onto me

270
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:43,960
that I'm not responsible for.

271
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:44,720
You young people

272
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:46,660
shouldn't always make a big deal
out of everything.

273
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:48,940
Everyone has been through this.

274
00:20:56,350 --> 00:20:57,160
Forget it.

275
00:20:57,380 --> 00:20:58,510
You can get off work.

276
00:20:58,610 --> 00:20:59,940
I'll do the rest myself.

277
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,400
Take your things.

278
00:21:15,850 --> 00:21:16,510
Fu Shize.

279
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:18,720
Thank you.

280
00:21:19,850 --> 00:21:20,850
Thank me for what?

281
00:21:21,490 --> 00:21:23,270
Thank you for helping me out.

282
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:25,570
Thankfully, you were there with me.

283
00:21:25,570 --> 00:21:26,270
I just

284
00:21:26,270 --> 00:21:28,070
blurted it all out back there...

285
00:21:30,250 --> 00:21:31,720
If I have to say it again now,

286
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:33,250
I'll definitely stutter.

287
00:21:37,140 --> 00:21:39,600
Weren't you off work already?

288
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:41,810
What made you come back all of a sudden?

289
00:21:42,530 --> 00:21:43,420
Xia said it was so late,

290
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:44,460
and you hadn't returned yet.

291
00:21:44,460 --> 00:21:45,520
She was so worried.

292
00:21:46,050 --> 00:21:47,480
I'll text Xia.

293
00:21:50,310 --> 00:21:52,180
M-My phone is dead.

294
00:21:52,350 --> 00:21:53,070
Can you help me

295
00:21:53,070 --> 00:21:54,510
tell Xia?

296
00:21:54,610 --> 00:21:55,420
Tell her what?

297
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:58,370
Just tell her we are already together.

298
00:22:05,350 --> 00:22:07,350
I mean we have already...

299
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:10,550
m-met up.

300
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:17,400
Yun Li was working overtime in the office.

301
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,070
She's fine.

302
00:22:18,250 --> 00:22:19,910
Let's go. I'll give you a ride.

303
00:22:26,700 --> 00:22:29,310
I want to go for a walk. May I?

304
00:22:31,090 --> 00:22:32,420
Are you feeling better?

305
00:22:33,350 --> 00:22:34,310
Much better.

306
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:35,250
Mm.

307
00:22:44,270 --> 00:22:45,470
This looks so pretty.

308
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,960
