316
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:24,660
Okay.

317
00:23:31,820 --> 00:23:32,450
Paid.

318
00:23:32,470 --> 00:23:33,400
Okay, thank you.

319
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:39,010
Hey there,

320
00:23:39,010 --> 00:23:40,270
