321
00:23:40,270 --> 00:23:42,070
We offer all sorts of items here.

322
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:46,480
During one Mid-Autumn Festival
when I was a kid,

323
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:48,350
I spent all my savings

324
00:23:48,350 --> 00:23:49,380
