328
00:23:53,740 --> 00:23:56,400
It was indeed not very safe
to set off fireworks.

329
00:23:58,090 --> 00:23:59,630
Can we light them here?

330
00:24:01,010 --> 00:24:01,500
Mm.

331
00:24:08,010 --> 00:24:08,810
Come closer.

332
00:24:21,250 --> 00:24:24,060
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

333
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,330
I mean the sparkler.

334
00:24:24,820 --> 00:24:27,470
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

335
00:24:28,270 --> 00:24:30,680
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

336
00:24:30,700 --> 00:24:33,900
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

337
00:24:34,810 --> 00:24:37,900
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

338
00:24:38,390 --> 00:24:40,550
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

339
00:24:40,820 --> 00:24:43,860
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

340
00:24:43,330 --> 00:24:44,480
It's so beautiful.

341
00:24:44,560 --> 00:24:47,860
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

342
00:24:49,430 --> 00:24:52,360
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

343
00:24:52,380 --> 00:24:54,540
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

344
00:24:56,410 --> 00:24:59,360
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

345
00:24:59,390 --> 00:25:01,680
