346
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:06,330
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

347
00:25:06,500 --> 00:25:09,360
♪ To meet the moon ♪

348
00:25:09,380 --> 00:25:12,310
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

349
00:25:12,340 --> 00:25:15,230
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

350
00:25:15,250 --> 00:25:19,410
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

351
00:25:18,790 --> 00:25:19,830
I could have drawn

352
00:25:19,740 --> 00:25:22,610
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

353
00:25:19,830 --> 00:25:20,940
a great work.

354
00:25:21,220 --> 00:25:21,820
Try again.

355
00:25:22,720 --> 00:25:26,460
♪ Love gives us all ♪

356
00:25:25,900 --> 00:25:27,110
Have you tried it before?

357
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:29,540
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

358
00:25:28,610 --> 00:25:29,140
Mm,

359
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:30,380
♪ You know ♪

360
00:25:29,750 --> 00:25:30,920
